   {
    "id": "ASM_FRONT_WALL_CLEARANCE",
    "statement": "The 8 mm wall thickness is maintained uniformly around the loft, including at the front wall opposite the rear access opening and mounting holes, at every Z station including the Y-shifted stations.",
    "rationale": "Brief requires the rear cut and holes not touch the front wall but does not give an explicit front-wall minimum; derived from the stated uniform 8 mm shell thickness.",
